  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut potato into fries and place on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with BBQ spice blend, season with salt and drizzle with olive oil. <br>• Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68bfcaf23cfb117858755aa0/step-ccf03b00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into half-moons. Grate carrot. Finely chop or crush garlic. <br>• In a small bowl, combine the honey, white wine vinegar, garlic, the chilli flakes (if using) and a splash of water.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68bfcaf23cfb117858755aa0/step-7f937710.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When fries have 10 mins remaining, pat haloumi dry, then cut into 1cm-thick slices. <br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. <br>• Remove pan from heat, then add hot honey mixture, turning haloumi to coat.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68bfcaf23cfb117858755aa0/step-3223c720.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a second medium bowl, combine cucumber, carrot, salad leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste with salt and pepper. <br>• Divide hot honey-glazed haloumi, seasoned fries and garden salad<br>between plates. <br>• Drizzle any remaining glaze from the pan over haloumi. Serve with <br>the mayonnaise.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68bfcaf23cfb117858755aa0/step-16c9a330.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
